      "text": "```\nFIVE CATEGORIES OF GRID STORAGE\n================================="
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#014",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:energy-storage:00-overview, git-history:energy-storage:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "energy-storage/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "energy-storage/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:energy-storage:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "energy-storage",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "energy-storage",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Energy Storage - Landscape Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "1. ELECTROCHEMICAL\n   ---------------------------------------------\n   | BATTERIES: convert chemical energy <-> electrical energy\n   | via electrochemical reactions at electrodes\n   |\n   | Li-ion: 150-300 Wh/kg, 80-95% RTE, 1-4 hr\n   | Flow: 20-50 Wh/L (external tank), 65-80% RTE, 2-20 hr\n   | Lead-acid: 30-50 Wh/kg, 70-85% RTE, 2-8 hr\n   | NaS (sodium-sulfur): 150 Wh/kg, 70-80% RTE, operates at 300 C\n   |\n   | Supercapacitors (EDLC): electrostatic (no reaction)\n   |   1-10 Wh/kg, 95%+ RTE, <1 min\n   ---------------------------------------------"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#015",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:energy-storage:00-overview, git-history:energy-storage:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "energy-storage/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "energy-storage/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:energy-storage:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "energy-storage",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "energy-storage",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Energy Storage - Landscape Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "2. MECHANICAL\n   ---------------------------------------------\n   | Pumped hydro: E = mgh, 70-85% RTE\n   |   1,600 GW deployed -- 96% of all grid storage\n   | CAES: compressed air, 40-70% RTE (diabatic vs. adiabatic)\n   | Flywheel: kinetic energy, 85-95% RTE, short duration\n   | Gravity: mass raised, potential energy\n   ---------------------------------------------"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#016",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:energy-storage:00-overview, git-history:energy-storage:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "energy-storage/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "energy-storage/00-OVERVIEW.md",
