        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "energy-storage",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "energy-storage",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Energy Storage - Landscape Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "3. THERMAL\n   ---------------------------------------------\n   | Sensible heat: molten salt (CSP), water, rocks\n   |   ETES (Electric Thermal Energy Storage)\n   | Latent heat: phase change materials (PCM)\n   |   Ice storage, paraffin wax, salt hydrates\n   | Thermochemical: reversible reactions\n   ---------------------------------------------"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#017",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
