        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Energy Storage - Landscape Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "4. CHEMICAL (Hydrogen and Derivatives)\n   ---------------------------------------------\n   | Electrolysis: electricity -> H2\n   | Compression/liquefaction: store H2\n   | Fuel cell: H2 -> electricity\n   | Chemical carriers: ammonia, LOHC\n   | Round-trip: ~25-40% (electrolysis x FC)\n   ---------------------------------------------"
    },
